OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric Kent castle goes up for
OL,4,Asale for #5m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic castle in Kent where King
OL,7,FHenry VIII and Anne Boleyn are said to
OL,8,Fhave dined has been put on the market
OL,9,Ffor #5m.
OL,11,FAllington Castle, near Maidstone, is a
OL,12,Frestored 12th Century medieval building
OL,13,Fset in about 42 acres of woodland and
OL,14,Friverside grounds next to the River
OL,15,FMedway.
OL,17,FSir Robert Worcester, the American born
OL,18,Ffounder of polling company Mori, lived
OL,19,Fin the castle from the late 1990s but
OL,20,Fthe property but has been put up for
OL,21,Fsale after his death in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
