OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric Kent castle goes up for
OL,4,Asale for #5m
OL,5,
OL,6,FOli Streeter, from estate agent Knight
OL,7,FFrank, is one of those showing
OL,8,Fpotential buyers around and said the
OL,9,Ffamily were "looking for the next
OL,10,Fcustodian... to take on Allington for
OL,11,Fthe next 20, 30, 40 years, just like
OL,12,FSir Robert".
